<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρί̆φυλλ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clover, Trifolium
				fragiferum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.132
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				97 xxxiii 16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίφυλλος, ἡ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.147
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίσφυλλον.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>treacle clover, Psoralea bituminosa,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.109
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατύριον</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				128
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύθοον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also (in acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ον</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀντιοχικὴ ἰσχάς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.4.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trefoil ornament,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Inscr.Délos
				1441
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				i90
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλα τ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1442
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				36
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
